    "body": "Unblocked by stacking (decided by the maintainer's collaborator, 2026-11-16: \"Stack\").\n\n- Branch this work off `issue/1962-trunnion-schema` (PR #2162, reviewed, merges at the next cut), not off `main`. The PR says \"stacked on #2162\" and uses `--base issue/1962-trunnion-schema`. At the cut, #2162 merges first, then this PR is retargeted to `main`.\n- #1966 (G93 inverse-time feed) has no PR yet, and the stack is one level only. Do not wait for it. Post 3-axis and 3+2 (positioned) programs now. Refuse simultaneous 4/5-axis feed moves by name (\"needs #1966: inverse-time feed\") until #1966 merges. Never post them with a plain feed.\n- Clean room: write the post from Mach4's public G-code documentation only.\n",
